&quot;game modifiers&quot; that have a chance to be applied to each round. There's a random chance for each modifier to be selected. Once you have encountered a modifier, it is &quot;unlocked&quot; and can be toggled in a custom game. There are plenty of secrets and easter eggs to discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---Tribute to the Doppels---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your everyday average doppel. Please take a moment to sympathize with them. Just trying to mind their own business, brainlessly wandering indefinitely around the map. That's all they want to do, and players keep running around acting like they own the place. So underappreciated... Doppels, we thank you for your sacrifice.</p>","developers":["Egg Salad Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104670/a6013949fdbd525eba754072a8c380967bc37a3a/header.jpg?t=1771340727","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 200 MB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3104670/1863771104/b0fbb1317d38bdcdb2bbe753b54aba7edd4f5d3a/1760964456/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760965603","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3104670/1863771104/b0fbb1317d38bdcdb2bbe753b54aba7edd4f5d3a/1760964456/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760965603","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3104670/1863771104/b0fbb1317d38bdcdb2bbe753b54aba7edd4f5d3a/1760964456/hls_264_master.m3u8?